  "body": "First signed contribution by **tosman** to the open phase-2 ceremony.\n\n- Contribution: `65cbe4db248743a1cca1b49414f4d98a0b882529a7da3b4593df2951b8312198`\n- Transcript: `551ba6e7b91b32169f1f44c42aea1fbd7216da783e4543628ccb3cb3fcb9dbeb`\n- Rust chain verification and SSH signature verification passed.\n- Operator-controlled contribution; not an independent participant.\n- Open ceremony, not final parameters. Contributions close at Bitcoin 970141; beacon at 970285.\n\n[Announcement published before contribution](https://github.com/tosnetwork/tos/releases/tag/shielded-pool-phase2-announcement-v2).\n\n[Contribution record and validation](https://github.com/tosnetwork/tos/blob/0ed59239c/artifacts/phase2/CONTRIBUTION-1.md).\n\nThe archive contains only public ceremony files, the signed attestation, registered public key, announcement and verification evidence. No signing private key is included.\n"
